{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Closed the configuration-change question's disposition and recorded the two knowledge uses its refutation depends on, then opened an independent persistence question. The suspicion that a crash could lose a granted vote before the vote response is refuted for the captured batch path: only Replicate and Ping are emitted before SaveRaftState, the log DB commits each state and its entries in one atomic write batch, and every remaining message, including RequestVoteResp and HeartbeatResp, is forwarded only afterwards. Added nine source ranges, one behavior entry, the new question and a refuted interpretation that keeps the free-order exception and storage-durability assumptions as limits. Validation reports valid, no_change false, no execution requested.\"}"}}
